# Security headers for static frontend assets (Cloudflare Workers static
# assets honors this file). API responses set their own headers in api.js.
#
# CSP notes: the UI uses inline <script>/<style> plus the Tailwind Play
# runtime, so 'unsafe-inline' is required until the frontend moves to a build
# step. The runtime itself is vendored at /vendor/tailwind/tailwindcss-3.4.17.js
# (2026-10-16, pinned to the version cdn.tailwindcss.com served that day) —
# self-hosted so a corporate firewall that blocks the CDN cannot unstyle IES
# Lens, and so script-src needs no third-party host at all. connect-src 'self'
# — the API is same-origin. frame-ancestors 'none' blocks clickjacking wrappers
# around the search UI; the one exception, /contents?embed=1 framed by the IES
# sites, is applied in the Worker (api.ts allowFramingByIes), not here.
#
# img-src also allows ies.org: an ANSI/IES LS-1 definition may include a figure,
# and Definition result cards reproduce the definition as published (client
# DO33). The figures are hosted on ies.org's own media library, so the two hosts
# below are the entire surface — the definition HTML is sanitized to an
# allowlist server-side (src/lib/definitions.js) before it is ever rendered.
#
# lighting.ies.org is the cover-thumbnail host, CONFIRMED 2026-08-24 against a
# live key: GET /api/portal/ies/Thumbnail?externalKey=<guid> answers 200
# image/png with no credential, so the cover can be loaded straight from an
# <img> — no proxy and no reader session. store.ies.org and the Vitrium hosts
# stay allowed for covers supplied by an explicit Thumbnail column.
#
# Nothing else on the page depends on these hosts, and every cover carries an
# onerror fallback, so a blocked or missing image degrades to the "No cover"
# placeholder rather than a broken-image icon.
#
# frame-src www.loom.com (2026-09-23): /tutorials embeds the Loom walkthroughs
# IES records on its own account; cdn.loom.com serves their poster frames. The
# ONLY page that frames anything, and frame-ancestors stays 'none' — we embed
# Loom, nobody embeds us.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://ies.org https://www.ies.org https://store.ies.org https://lighting.ies.org https://api.vitrium.com https://view.protectedpdf.com https://cdn.loom.com; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.loom.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
